// Fixed storage repeats one admitted unsigned element. An i64 element is not
// one of them, so the annotation is refused at the type instead of being
// silently widened or lowered as bytes.
//
// Positive coverage for the admitted u8/u32/u64 elements lives in the
// differential cases and the fixed-array LIR, VM and XIR suites.
var lanes: [i64; 2] = [1, 2]
print(lanes[0])
